<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="git-addon-git-staging-view">
  <title>Git Staging View</title>
  <shortdesc>The controls in the <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> Git Staging view, region by
    region.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Staging view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
    <section id="section_overview">
      <title>Overview</title>
      <p>Open the <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-view"/>
        view from <menucascade><uicontrol>Window</uicontrol><uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol><uicontrol>Git
            Staging</uicontrol></menucascade>, from
        <menucascade><uicontrol>Tools</uicontrol><uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol></menucascade>, or
        from the <uicontrol conkeyref="menu-uicontrols/menu-git"/>
        menu.</p>
      <p>
        <fig>
          <title>Git Staging View</title>
          <image href="img/staging/staging_view.png" placement="inline"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_toolbar">
      <title>Toolbar</title>
      <simpletable relcolwidth="1* 2*" frame="all">
        <sthead>
          <stentry>Control</stentry>
          <stentry>Description</stentry>
        </sthead>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-push"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Sends your local commits to the remote.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-pull"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Brings remote commits into your branch. In the Vertical Ellipsis menu, the pull
            actions are grouped under a <uicontrol>Pull</uicontrol> submenu (same as in the Git
            menu).</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-stash"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Stashes changes or lists existing stashes.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-open-history"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-git-history-view.dita"><uicontrol>Git
                History</uicontrol> view</xref> for the current repository.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-open-branch-manager"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens the <xref href="git-addon-git-branch-manager-view.dita"><uicontrol>Git
                Branch Manager</uicontrol> view</xref>.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow id="section_ellipsis_menu">
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-ellipsis"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Opens a menu with repository setup, synchronization, ignore, configuration, and
            credential actions.</stentry>
        </strow>
      </simpletable>
    </section>
    <section id="section_header">
      <title>Header</title>
      <simpletable relcolwidth="1* 2*" frame="all">
        <sthead>
          <stentry>Control</stentry>
          <stentry>Description</stentry>
        </sthead>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-working-copy"
            /></stentry>
          <stentry>Selects the active working copy, or browses for one on disk.</stentry>
        </strow>
        <strow>
          <stentry><uicontrol
              conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-branch"/></stentry>
          <stentry>Shows the current branch and switches to another local branch.</stentry>
        </strow>
      </simpletable>
    </section>
    <section id="section_file_areas">
      <title>File Areas and Stage Controls</title>
      <p>The <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-unstaged-files"/> area lists changed files,
        while the <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-staged-files"/> area lists files ready to
        commit. The actions between them move files back and forth (<uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-stage-selected"/>, <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-stage-all"/>, <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-unstage-selected"/>, and <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-unstage-all"/>). Right-click a file for contextual actions
        such as compare, open, stage, discard, resolve conflict, show history, show blame, and show
        in the system file manager. Use <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-toogle-view"/> to
        toggle the view mode between a flat list and a folder tree.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_commit_area">
      <title>Commit Area</title>
      <p>Enter a message in the <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-commit-message"/> area and
        select <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-commit"/>. The message toolbar includes the
        following actions: <uicontrol conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-generate-ai"/>, <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-previous-comment"/>, <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-amend"/>, and <uicontrol
          conkeyref="gs-uicontrols/gs-auto-push"/>.</p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
